amaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706686721","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:40:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5027540-1846651706684277","game_id":"steam-5027540","kind":"update","title":"Update: New PC Interface and More Realistic Models","summary":"Hi everyone playing BREACHED: Follow Me! 👋I've rolled out a visual update:🖥️ PC interfaceI redesigned the in-game computer interface. It looks cleaner now, closer to a real PC, and fits the atmosphere better.🧱 Updated modelsI replaced and refined some of the models so the environment looks more realistic and alive.Thank you for the feedback and bug reports, they really help make the game better. Let me know if you notice anything!See you in the game.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T10:36:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706684277","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:40:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5027540-1845383656391865","game_id":"steam-5027540","kind":"update","title":"Small Demo Update. More Interactions & Visual Improvements. 0.2.1","summary":"A small update for the BREACHED: Follow Me demo is now available.I’ve seen that many of you wanted more objects to interact with, so this update adds more interactive elements across the demo.What’s changed?Added more objects that the player can interact withImproved the appearance and overall detail of the environmentAdded and adjusted several environmental objectsMade various small visual improvements across the mapThis is a smaller update focused mainly on making the environment feel more det","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-04T19:08:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656391865","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:40:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5027540-1845383656381950","game_id":"steam-5027540","kind":"update","title":"Autumn Has Arrived — Demo Update","summary":"Autumn has arrived in BREACHED: Follow Me.The latest update gives the demo a new seasonal atmosphere, along with a number of visual improvements and smaller fixes.What’s new?🍂 New autumn atmosphere across the demo 🌳 Updated trees, vegetation, and fallen leaves 🏙️ Improved environmental details in several areas 📰 Updated in-game elements to fit the autumn setting 💡 Lighting and visual improvements 🔧 Various bug fixes and small adjustmentsDevelopment of BREACHED: Follow Me is continuing, and there","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T15:52:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656381950","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:40:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5027540-1840944183788925","game_id":"steam-5027540","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch 0.1.5: Bug Fixes + Updated VHS Effect","summary":"Hi everyone playing BREACHED: Follow Me! I’ve released a small patch: 🐛 Bug fixesFixed several bugs that affected gameplay. 📼 VHS effectUpdated the VHS effect — the atmosphere now feels even stronger. Thanks for the feedback and bug reports — they really help make the game better. Let me know if you find anything!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-18T14:14:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183788925","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:40:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5027540-1840310314353716","game_id":"steam-5027540","kind":"update","title":"Demo update: message history, mug coaster hint + fixes","summary":"Hey everyone who's played the demo! 👋Made a small update based on your feedback:📜 Message History All the lines and hints that appeared during the game are now saved in a separate log. If you missed something or want to reread it, you no longer need to replay the level.☕ Mug Placement Hint Added a visual hint on the table to make it clearer where exactly to place your mug. I know some of you got stuck here, it should be more obvious now.🐛 Fixes Also fixed a few small bugs along the way.Thanks to","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-11T10:25:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314353716","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:40:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5027540-1840310314347272","game_id":"steam-5027540","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Bug Fixes + New Ending","summary":"Hey everyone! Pushed a small patch for the demo: • Fixed several bugs that could break the playthrough • Reworked the demo's ending — felt the previous one wasn't good enough, so I decided to make it better No spoilers, but the finale hits different now. If you've already played it, worth giving it another shot 👀 Thanks for the feedback, it genuinely helps make the game better!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-08T11:21:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314347272","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:40:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5027540-1840310314344820","game_id":"steam-5027540","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update #1","summary":"Hey everyone,I've been going through all the comments and discussions since the demo launched, and I just wanted to say thanks. A few of the bugs you reported never showed up during my own testing, so your feedback has been incredibly helpful.Here's what's new:You can now start a New Game without having to restart the entire demo.Fixed several reported bugs and polished a few rough spots.If you run into any other issues or have suggestions, feel free to post them in the Bug Reports discussion. I","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-07T12:07:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314344820","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:40:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5027540":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:16:23Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:16:22Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5027540":"2026-10-26T07:16:23Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5027540":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:16:22Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:16:22Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:16:22Z"},"5028120":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:16:23Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:16:23Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:16:23Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5027540","app_id":5027540,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:18Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"3a01bd1a1d32ac44850ab05cc16d8c8f8ea3817a7e5bdbacad5b9a24329b59fa","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"VHS 분위기와 동유럽을 배경으로 한 1인칭 심리 공포 게임. 어두운 장소를 탐험하고, 숨겨진 비밀을 파헤치며, 현실이 보이는 것과 다를 수 있는 이야기를 발견하세요.","publishers":[{"name":"GrimHouse Games","creator_clan_account_id":46233967}],"developers":[{"name":"dntbshmd"}],"franchises":[{"name":"BREACHED"}]},"release":{"is_coming_soon":true,"custom_release_date_message":"출시 예정","coming_soon_dis